WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
Start with the part you can observe.

00:12.000 --> 00:24.000
Follow the relationship as it changes.

00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
Surface hierarchy distinguishes major volumes from secondary transitions and small details. Contrast and edge flow guide attention.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
Trace the largest uninterrupted surface first, then mark where a crease redirects the eye toward a wheel arch.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Layer order critique

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
A view can support interpretation; it cannot prove hidden structure or compliance by itself.

